{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-07_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-07","title":"暴君","storyCode":"1-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"c6c7ccf2cc71c23fa384c29174cb78115f431be5b4dbb4e36f8f2f758ff3497a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"整合運動從各個角落湧現出來，將博士一行困在了廣場當中。\n然後，整合運動的暴君——塔露拉，向他們緩緩走來。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈，哈....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不僅擊退了整合運動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"災勢也在以肉眼可見的程度衰弱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"情況太糟糕了......各位還是要多加小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"天災......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"原本的街道都被倒塌的廢墟掩蓋，被摧毀的建築，形成了障礙物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"源石，已經開始瘋長了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"明明到了最後關頭，所有事情卻都在阻撓我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動？他們追上來了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多的......整合運動......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......不是追上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——從各個地方湧了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"廣場，坡道，建築......四處的廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這個數量，呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪除了那些真的要被砸成泥漿的人以外，他們一點都不懼怕天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕天災，說多些......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"已經消滅了他們一半人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的也夠把我們在這裡淹死十幾次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"別停下腳步！繼續順著撤退路線行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"在開闊地帶停下等於找死！至少到達廣場出口處之後再整頓隊形！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"必須戰鬥。破開突圍口以後，趁對方隊伍混亂立刻脫離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"能行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"希望渺茫，但我們沒有別的辦法。只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是數十倍於自己數量的敵人，如果只是些暴徒，羅德島依然有機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"無需驚慌！備戰姿態！防禦陣形！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的數量，如果要拿下切爾諾伯格，也許......真的有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"實在......太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動究竟......是從哪裡糾集起這麼多感染者的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這種包圍網......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動是真的，很看得起我們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"大，大群整合運動敵人......包圍了廣場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人停止了行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有敵人一名，正在靠近羅德島的陣線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，那個人會一個人，走向我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"難道敵人派出了使者？不可能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她是資料上，整合運動的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"她身上，有某種氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......臨光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚，但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......鋼鐵和硫磺的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼東西在焚燒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是火焰的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的各位幹員......最高警戒狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......她就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的暴君......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"大概......是能燒盡整片大地的火焰吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]}]}
